 CBMui args;obj;msg
⍝ One callback for the whole demo. The card's two native buttons read and set
⍝ the MUI controls' values; everything else just reports its event.
 obj←⊃args
 :Select obj
 :Case 'F1.CARD.READ'
     msg←'Text: ',('F1.TXT'eWG'Text'),'  State: ',(⍕'F1.SW'eWG'State')
     msg,←'  Value: ',(⍕'F1.SL'eWG'Value'),'  SelItems: ',⍕'F1.SEL'eWG'SelItems'
 :Case 'F1.CARD.SET'
     'F1.TXT'eWS'Text' 'Set by ⎕WS'
     'F1.SW'eWS'State' 0
     'F1.SL'eWS'Value' 45
     'F1.SEL'eWS'SelItems'(0 0 1)
     msg←'Set from APL'
 :Else
     msg←obj,' ',(2⊃args),': ',⍕2↓args
 :EndSelect
 'F1.OUT'eWS'Caption'msg
